<div class="pub-concept-play pub-card" x-data="{pattern:'imbuhan'}"><span class="pub-kicker">TEKAN DAN LIHAT!</span><h3>Rapat atau jarak?</h3><div class="pub-concept-switch" aria-label="Pilih pola ejaan"><button type="button" @click="pattern='imbuhan'" :aria-pressed="pattern==='imbuhan'">di- <small>Rapat</small></button><button type="button" @click="pattern='sendi'" :aria-pressed="pattern==='sendi'">di <small>Jarak</small></button></div><div class="pub-concept-result" aria-live="polite"><template x-if="pattern==='imbuhan'"><div><span class="pub-example-picture" aria-hidden="true">✍️</span><strong>ditulis · dibaca · dimasak</strong><p>Imbuhan di- + kata kerja pasif.</p><span class="pub-tag">Tulis rapat!</span></div></template><template x-if="pattern==='sendi'"><div><span class="pub-example-picture" aria-hidden="true">🏫</span><strong>di sekolah · di rumah</strong><p>Kata sendi di + tempat.</p><span class="pub-tag">Ada jarak!</span></div></template></div><noscript><p>Imbuhan: ditulis, dibaca. Kata sendi: di sekolah, di rumah.</p></noscript></div>
